    T-057: an early parry click waits for the shot

    A strike up to 0.3 s before a shot comes within the parry window is held
    instead of swinging, and parries the shot when it comes in. The look-ahead
    of the strike-parry was one step too long: a window of N steps guards only
    N - 1 flights, so a shot touching on the last one hit through an open
    parry. Fixed with a test.

