<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf8><meta name=viewport content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><style>:root{color-scheme:light;box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}body{margin:0;padding:0;font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#000}img{max-width:100%}[hidden]:not([hidden=until-found i]){display:none!important}</style></head><body>
<title>Ronin Concept Round 1</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: one dark arena-night page, a pick row per role (hero, boss), then arenas, props and the lineup as reference. */
:root {
  --night: #0d0b17;
  --panel: #171428;
  --line: #2c2747;
  --ink: #ece8f6;
  --muted: #a39cc0;
  --cyan: #3fe6f0;
  --magenta: #ff3fae;
  --gold: #e7b84a;
  --display: "Chakra Petch", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --body: "IBM Plex Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
body { background: var(--night); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--body); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; }
.wrap { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding-inline: 20px; padding-block: 36px 64px; display: grid; gap: 48px; }
header { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
.eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cyan); }
h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
h1 span { color: var(--magenta); }
.lede { color: var(--muted); max-width: 64ch; margin: 0; }
h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .02em; }
section { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.sechead { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 8px; }
.sechead p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
.grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr)); }
.grid.wide { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 460px), 1fr)); }
figure { margin: 0; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; min-width: 0; }
figure.pick { border-color: var(--cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--cyan) inset; }
figure a { display: block; background: #c8c8cc; }
figure img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.tall img { aspect-ratio: 2 / 3; object-fit: contain; }
figcaption { padding: 14px 16px 16px; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.tag { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; }
.code { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
.badge { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--night); background: var(--cyan); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; }
figcaption p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
.how { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 3px solid var(--magenta); border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px 18px; display: grid; gap: 6px; max-width: 72ch; }
.how p { margin: 0; }
.how code { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--gold); }
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--magenta); outline-offset: 2px; }
.tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px; }
.tabs button { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--muted); background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 18px; cursor: pointer; }
.tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { color: var(--night); background: var(--cyan); border-color: var(--cyan); }
.panel { display: grid; gap: 48px; }
.tracks { display: grid; gap: 14px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); }
.track { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; display: grid; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
.track.wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-color: var(--magenta); }
.track p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
.track audio { width: 100%; }
/* Models: per asset the sheet it came from beside a turnable view of what was made, then its numbers. */
.models { display: grid; gap: 20px; }
.model { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 220px) minmax(0, 1fr); min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; }
.model .sheet { background: #c8c8cc; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.model .sheet img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; max-height: 420px; object-fit: contain; }
.model .stage { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto auto; min-width: 0; }
.model model-viewer { width: 100%; height: 420px; max-width: 100%; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #2a2546 0%, #120f20 75%); --poster-color: transparent; }
.model .info { padding: 14px 16px 16px; display: grid; gap: 10px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.model .info p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
.stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.stats div { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
.stats dt { color: var(--muted); }
.stats dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); }
.controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.controls select, .controls button { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--night); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 9px; }
.controls button { cursor: pointer; }
.controls button[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--cyan); color: var(--cyan); }
.state { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--night); background: var(--gold); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 3px; }
.views { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 6px; }
.views img { width: 100%; background: #f2f2f4; border-radius: 3px; display: block; }
.cards { display: grid; gap: 20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); }
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .model { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .model .sheet img { max-height: 260px; }
  .model model-viewer { height: 340px; }
}
</style>
<script type="module" src="https://unpkg.com/@google/model-viewer@3.5.0/dist/model-viewer.min.js"></script>

<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">MegaJam 2026 · art and sound</div>
    <h1>Ronin: <span>Final Cut</span></h1>
    <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Sections">
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-concepts" aria-controls="panel-concepts" aria-selected="true">Concepts</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-sounds" aria-controls="panel-sounds" aria-selected="false">Sounds</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-models" aria-controls="panel-models" aria-selected="false">Models</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div id="panel-concepts" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-concepts" class="panel">
  <p class="lede">The hero and boss models are built from these sheets. The arenas, props and lineup are here for reference. The current pick is outlined in cyan, so it stands until you say otherwise. Click an image to open it at full size.</p>

  <div class="how">
    <p><strong>How to answer:</strong> write it in the Claude Code chat, e.g. <code>hero A, boss A</code>, or describe what you would change (e.g. <code>hero A with the kasa hat of B</code>). A changed brief becomes concept round 2.</p>
  </div>

  <section aria-labelledby="hero">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="hero">Hero, the ronin</h2><p>Top-down camera: the silhouette and the glowing trim carry it.</p></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <figure class="pick tall">
        <a href="img/r1_hero_a.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_hero_a.png" alt="Hero A: lean ronin in a black kimono with cyan and magenta neon piping, face mask, topknot, one armoured shoulder"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Hero A <span class="badge">current pick</span><span class="code">r1_hero_a</span></div><p>Lean, black kimono with cyan and magenta piping, a mask, a topknot, one armoured shoulder. Matches the lineup and both arena paintings.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r1_hero_b.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_hero_b.png" alt="Hero B: ronin in a kasa straw hat with a cyan rim, indigo coat with magenta trim, masked face"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Hero B <span class="code">r1_hero_b</span></div><p>A kasa hat with a glowing cyan rim, indigo coat with magenta trim. The hat reads very well from above, but it hides the head and the face.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="boss">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="boss">Boss, the Publisher</h2><p>He steals the hero's moves and cuts the game apart.</p></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r1_boss_a.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_boss_a.png" alt="Boss A: huge man in a charcoal three-piece suit and red tie, black and gold samurai shoulder armour, a kabuto helmet whose crest is a rising stock-chart arrow, gold grinning mask"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss A <span class="code">r1_boss_a</span></div><p>Charcoal three-piece suit, red tie, black and gold armour. The kabuto crest is a rising sales-chart arrow under a grinning gold mask.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r1_boss_b.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_boss_b.png" alt="Boss B: tall grey-haired man in a white pinstripe double-breasted suit, a black and gold cloud-pattern long coat, gold shoulder and shin armour, gold sunglasses"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss B <span class="code">r1_boss_b</span></div><p>White pinstripe suit, a long black coat with gold clouds, gold armour, sunglasses and a smirk. More of an executive and less of a warlord; the white suit stands out on the dark arena.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="bossc2">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="bossc2">Boss C2, round 3: the sumo executive</h2><p>Your pick: C2 without the gold belt, the tie and gold gloves kept. Plus three satirical takes: the publisher as a developer sees him.</p></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <figure class="pick tall">
        <a href="img/r4_boss_c2c_final.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r4_boss_c2c_final.png" alt="The final Publisher: sumo-built executive with glowing gold dollar-sign eyes, a gold tooth, an open cream suit over a black shirt, a plain gold tie, a dollar lapel pin, banknotes in the breast pocket, red cuffs, gold knuckle guards"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">The Publisher <span class="badge">final</span><span class="code">r4_boss_c2c_final</span></div><p>C2c with a plain tie, the phone and chart taken off. The model is made from this sheet. On every hit he bleeds paper dollars (VFX, next session).</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r3_boss_c2b.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r3_boss_c2b.png" alt="Boss C2b: sumo-built executive in an open cream suit over a black shirt with no belt, a gold tie, gold knuckle guards, a red pocket square, a small top knot"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">C2b <span class="code">r3_boss_c2b</span></div><p>C2 as asked: no belt or sash, the gold tie and the gold gloves as they were.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r3_boss_c2c.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r3_boss_c2c.png" alt="Boss C2c: the same executive with glowing gold dollar-sign eyes, a gold tooth in a toothy grin, a dollar lapel pin, banknotes stuffed in the pocket, a phone with a rising chart clipped to his tie"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">C2c <span class="code">r3_boss_c2c</span></div><p>Dollar-sign eyes, a gold tooth, cash in the pocket, a phone on the tie showing the chart going up.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r3_boss_c2d.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r3_boss_c2d.png" alt="Boss C2d: the executive in a cream suit printed all over with gold dollar signs, a crown of stacked gold coins, a monocle, dollar signs on the gold knuckle guards"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">C2d <span class="code">r3_boss_c2d</span></div><p>A dollar-print suit, a crown of stacked coins, a monocle, dollar signs on the knuckles.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r3_boss_c2e.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r3_boss_c2e.png" alt="Boss C2e: the executive with a gold headset, dollar-sign sunglasses, a salesman grin, blank sticky notes all over his jacket, a red rubber stamp holstered on his hip, chains on his wrists"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">C2e <span class="code">r3_boss_c2e</span></div><p>The meeting man: a headset, dollar shades, blank sticky notes all over the jacket, a red "rejected" stamp holstered like a gun.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="bossc">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="bossc">Boss C, the heavy Publisher</h2><p>Round 2: a fat-cat corporate boss, slow and clumsy, but each blow crushes.</p></div>
    <div class="grid">
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r2_boss_c1.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r2_boss_c1.png" alt="Boss C1: huge bald man in a dark pinstripe three-piece suit with a red tie, gold watch chain over a giant belly, black and gold samurai shoulder guards"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss C1 <span class="code">r2_boss_c1</span></div><p>Pinstripe three-piece suit, a watch chain over the belly, samurai shoulder guards, a stock-arrow pin. Caution: bald, giant and in dark pinstripes, he sits close to a well-known comic crime boss. A hat or the kabuto would move him away.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r2_boss_c2.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r2_boss_c2.png" alt="Boss C2: sumo-built executive in an open cream suit, black shirt, gold tie, gold patterned obi sash over the belly, gold knuckle guards, small top knot"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss C2 <span class="code">r2_boss_c2</span></div><p>Sumo-built executive: open cream suit, a gold obi sash like a title belt, gold knuckle guards. The cream suit reads well from above on the dark arena.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r2_boss_c3.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r2_boss_c3.png" alt="Boss C3: obese armoured warlord in a dark suit, a round black and gold lacquered chest plate over the belly, kabuto with a rising stock-arrow crest, gold grinning mask"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss C3 <span class="code">r2_boss_c3</span></div><p>Boss A made heavy: the kabuto with the stock-arrow crest, the gold grinning mask, a round lacquered belly plate. Keeps the corporate-samurai link with the arena art.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="tall">
        <a href="img/r2_boss_c3b.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r2_boss_c3b.png" alt="Boss C3b: the same obese armoured warlord without the belly plate: a white shirt, red tie and charcoal waistcoat stretched over the belly, black and gold shoulder and forearm armour, kabuto with the stock-arrow crest, gold grinning mask"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Boss C3b <span class="code">r2_boss_c3b</span></div><p>C3 without the gold-banded belly plate: shirt, red tie and waistcoat stretched over the belly. Made from your answer "C3, but without the golden bell on his belly". Confirm or correct.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="lineup">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="lineup">Lineup, the scale</h2><p>Hero A next to Boss A: the size gap the models keep.</p></div>
    <div class="grid wide">
      <figure>
        <a href="img/r1_lineup.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_lineup.png" alt="Lineup: hero A beside boss A, the boss roughly one and a half times the hero's height"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Lineup <span class="code">r1_lineup</span></div><p>The boss stands about one and a half times the hero's height.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="arena">
    <div class="sechead"><h2 id="arena">Arena paintings</h2><p>Mood references for the neon rooftop, not a choice.</p></div>
    <div class="grid wide">
      <figure>
        <a href="img/r1_arena_a.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_arena_a.png" alt="Arena A: round rain-wet rooftop from above, a magenta neon ring, four glowing torii gates, lanterns and bonsai, city towers around"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Arena A <span class="code">r1_arena_a</span></div><p>The gameplay view: a round wet rooftop, a magenta ring, four torii gates. The in-game neon arena follows this layout.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <a href="img/r1_arena_b.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="img/r1_arena_b.png" alt="Arena B: low angle key art of the hero with a glowing katana facing the giant boss in the rain, papers flying"></a>
        <figcaption><div class="tag">Arena B <span class="code">r1_arena_b</span></div><p>Key art: the hero faces the giant Publisher while contracts fly in the rain. A candidate for the itch cover.</p></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

