        <figcaption><div class="tag">Walk <span class="code">Slow_Orc_Walk</span></div><p>Hunched heavy walk, in place. Before: the torso caves in at the waist. After: round belly, feet on the ground, flaps yield to the thighs. No foot slide at about 0.43 m/s.</p>
        <p class="code">166 frames, 5.5 s, loops · key frames: <a href="rig/keys_before_Slow_Orc_Walk.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">before</a> / <a href="rig/keys_after_Slow_Orc_Walk.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">after</a></p></figcaption>
