        <figcaption><div class="tag">Heavy attack: hammer swing <span class="code">Heavy_Hammer_Swing</span></div><p>Two-hand overhead blow. Before: the jacket tears open when the arms go up. After: the arms lift from the real shoulders, the jacket front hangs when he bends over.</p>
        <p class="code">56 frames, 1.83 s · key frames: <a href="rig/keys_before_Heavy_Hammer_Swing.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">before</a> / <a href="rig/keys_after_Heavy_Hammer_Swing.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">after</a></p></figcaption>
