        <figcaption><div class="tag">Slam <span class="code">Charged_Ground_Slam</span></div><p>Wind-up and a blow into the ground. Same fixes; the deep crouch keeps the belly whole.</p>
        <p class="code">91 frames, 3.0 s · key frames: <a href="rig/keys_before_Charged_Ground_Slam.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">before</a> / <a href="rig/keys_after_Charged_Ground_Slam.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">after</a></p></figcaption>
